UL LayaGo is extracted from UnicoLab's user-supplied Hive Go engine.
The original source fingerprints are recorded in docs/ORIGIN.json.

The implementation replicates the Laya architecture and sequence contract:
https://github.com/NandhaKishorM/laya
Upstream Laya is developed by Convai Innovations and licensed Apache-2.0.
The original engine's parity references pin Laya 0.3.5 (commit 573e5b62).
Upstream model weights are obtained separately and retain their own terms.

CLM research informs the training roadmap; no CLM code or weights are bundled:
https://github.com/Contrastive-LM/CLM
